This add-on changes the run-time behaviour of OpenDDE (Copyright 2026 Aureka AI Research, Apache-2.0, PyPI 'opendde'; itself derived from
Protenix, Copyright 2024 ByteDance and/or its affiliates, Apache-2.0) by wrapping its functions in the running process; no file of the installed
package is modified.
third_party/fpf_transition_odde — the FlashPairformer transition adapter for OpenDDE (the lean bf16 composition `sep16`).
odde_triattn_bind.py, odde_trimul_bind.py and odde_transition_bind.py bind the triangle-attention, triangle-multiplication and pair-transition sites
to the shared core's providers (the opt_core package, ../common/opt_core); no triangle-attention or triangle-multiplication kernel is included here.
It calls, and does not include, PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), NVIDIA cuEquivariance (NVIDIA licence, as installed) and Triton (MIT).
